You can rename/copy it to your app's www directory, then use an iframe to show it. Probably. :)

However, we are working on a Shiny binding for Leaflet <https://github.com/jcheng5/leaflet-shiny> that will be a more seamless fit, and let you react to map interactions using R code. See here for an example:
