Do you want to store the queries in the selectInput and have them executed when selected or are you creating the datasets beforehand? Either could work. For the 2nd option you could store the datasets in a reactive value (?reactiveValues) and 'open' them with the selectInput. For the first option you could put the queries in a list with the labels shown as options in the selectInput.

